## Reading the artifact bundle (`artifacts/<cap>/<timestamp>/`)
| File | Answers |
|---|---|
| `run_manifest.json` | Did it pass? source revision, host facts, content hashes, verify command. |
| `events.jsonl` | The detailed step-by-step log (inputs/decision/outputs/hashes/timing). |
| `commands.txt` | Exact commands run, in order. |
| `steps/<n>_*.log` | Full stdout+stderr of step <n>. |
| `degraded_receipt.json` | Present only if a required dependency was missing. |

## Exit codes
| Code | Meaning | Operator action |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | pass | none |
| non-zero (≠3) | fail-closed | open the failing step's `steps/*.log`; the `events.jsonl` `fail` event names the failing invariant |
| 3 | degraded (dependency unavailable) | install the missing dependency named in `degraded_receipt.json`, re-run |

